OL,3,GNEWSAMan wins double pickleball gold in
OL,4,Ajust 18 months
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who started playing pickleball
OL,7,Fonly a year and a half ago has been
OL,8,Fcrowned a double national champion.
OL,10,FJames Ling, 29, from Ipswich discovered
OL,11,Fthe sport while coaching tennis in the
OL,12,FUnited States and noticed how it was
OL,13,F"booming".
OL,15,FAt the start of November he took part
OL,16,Fin the English National Pickleball
OL,17,FChampionships in Bolton where he won
OL,18,Fgold in the men's doubles and the mixed
OL,19,Fdoubles.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
