OL,3,GNEWSAMan wins double pickleball gold in
OL,4,Ajust 18 months
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said of his wins: "If you would have
OL,7,Ftold me before I would have almost
OL,8,Flaughed at you, but coming away with
OL,9,Fthat [made me feel] on top of the
OL,10,Fworld."
